<title>UK: Bremer LB sets 500 mln Danish crown domestic bond.</title>
<headline>Bremer LB sets 500 mln Danish crown domestic bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bremer Landesbank has issued a 500 million Danish crown three-year domestic bond, joint lead managers BG Bank, NYKredit Bank and UBS said. There is a four percent coupon and the bonds will mature on December 20, 1999.</p>
<p>All other details remain undisclosed pending listing on the Copenhagen stock exchange. --London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
